      "expected_outcome": {
        "changes_within_hours": null,
        "no_change_bound_reason": "Changes only when its inputs moved. That it is not behind them is the asset reconciler's lag (root ADR-0333) and its lane's behind-inputs bound (root ADR-0444); a change bound here would report a source that published nothing."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "by_pnu_parcel_building_permits_bake",
      "scope": "changed-keys",
      "interruptible": true,
      "commits": "as_it_goes",
      "description": "Reflect each new Gold snapshot of gold.parcel_building_permits (the own-producer 건축인허가 kind, root ADR-0451) in R2 by-PNU serving (scripts/ops/by-pnu-serving-bake.sh parcel-building-permits), as section packs (root ADR-0147, ADR-0193 §9), exactly as the ownership bake. Its own job, as every own-producer kind's (root ADR-0303 §2). Nothing to do until the operator's first pack-only publish of the lane (root ADR-0190). Started when gold_parcel_building_permits_rebuild commits a new snapshot, and at 11:15 as the fallback (root ADR-0171). Two slots and MemoryMax=5G, the ownership bake's bound (root ADR-0138).",
      "capabilities": [
        "by_pnu_kind_section_pack_patches"
      ],
